    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d143">

                <pb facs="0227" n="180" xml:id="pg180"/>

                <head>143. Telegram 631 from Geneva<anchor n="1" xml:id="d143-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Geneva</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1955-08-26">August 26, 1955, 3
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d143-1" n="1" type="facsimile" xml:id="d143-1"/>
                <p>631. From Johnson.</p>
                <p>I have accepted Wang’s invitation to
                    private dinner Sunday evening. Would appreciate any indications Department could
                    give me by that time our thinking on future tactics. In absence anything from
                    Department will of course adhere same line and do maximum obtain any indication
                    shift in Wang’s position.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">Gowen</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
